#==============================================================================================
#
#   flex_formatting_context_6 - Layout::FlexFormattingContext: automatic sizes, cross-size
#                               contributions, intrinsic item sizes and static positions
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/FlexFormattingContext.cpp (lines 2070-2449): when main/cross sizes
#       are treated as auto and max sizes as none, the cross-size min/max-content contributions
#       of an item, the width used to find an item's intrinsic height, the intrinsic and
#       fit-content main and cross sizes of an item, stretched items, the computed main and
#       cross sizes, cross-axis auto margins, align-content: stretch, the static-position
#       rectangle of an absolutely positioned child, a flex line's sums of flex factors, and
#       the main and cross gaps.
